                <description language="en">Multimodal neuroimaging dataset from the Aarhus University UCB-J project including T1-weighted MRI, [11C]UCB-J PET, and FDG PET. The dataset includes healthy controls (young and older) and patients with Parkinson’s disease spectrum disorders (PD, DLB, PDD), organized in BIDS format. Keywords: Parkinson's disease, dementia with Lewy bodies, Parkinson's disease dementia, PET, [11C]UCB-J, FDG PET, MRI, T1-weighted MRI, synaptic density, glucose metabolism, healthy controls, aging; Participants: 63; Total size: 2.63 GB.</description>
